<title>BELGIUM: BBL/Vermeulen/Ferri reiterates Coil &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>BBL/Vermeulen/Ferri reiterates Coil &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name------Sector------------Price---------Broker-------</p>
<p>    Coil     Aluminium Processing  225 FrF BBL/Vermeulen/Ferri</p>
<p>COMMENT: Group loss of 151 million Belgian francs in 1996 versus forecast 80 million loss mainly due to changes in accounting practice and exceptional 85 million franc charge. Prospects for 1997 and 1998 very favourable, against background of firmer sales and lower debt charges. Discounting of excess cash flow gives target price of 350 French francs.</p>
<p>Recommendation: BUY. Analyst: Frederique Gottero-Nakache</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 07/03/97</p>
<p> Estimates:     EPS	pvs est    P/E	 Dividend</p>
<p>  1996	  -19.8 FRF   n/a	 n/a	    0 FRF</p>
<p>  1997	   14.4 FRF   n/a	15.6	    0 FRF</p>
<p>  1998	   32.1 FRF   n/a	 7.0	  5.1 FRF</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
